{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"9113f6895bb3c1522a19b0a14958f15cd80e1e2e30ceb732f73c30274b98611a","digest":{"component_or_area":"outbound type mapping and per-project type exclusion","key_entities":["config.effective_type_map","config.assert_type_decisions_complete","config.effective_excluded_sync_types","config.jira_to_local_type","LOCAL_TYPE_TO_JIRA","EXCLUDED_SYNC_TYPES","rebar-type:","mapping_config.SKIP","TicketType","outbound_fields._map_local_to_jira_fields","outbound_mutation_builders.py","outbound_labels._desired_type_annotation","inbound_fields.recover_type_label"],"problem_keywords":["type mapping","config-driven","skip mechanism","type granularity","round-trip safety","lossy type collapse","fail-closed validation"],"propositions":["Type mapping must be config-driven via MappingLayer type_map axis with per-project resolution, mirroring S2 status_map pattern","Fail-closed validation must fire once up-front in compute_outbound_mutations before the mutation loop, rejecting undecided syncable types","Type skip is signaled via mapping_config.SKIP sentinel and must exclude tickets from sync at both mutation-builder and absent-gets consumers","Lossy type collapse (when forward map does not reverse to local type) must stamp rebar-type: annotation label symmetric with rebar-status:, requiring a jira_to_local_type reverse map","type_map parameter must thread through all three OutboundMapper implementations and both field mappers (Cloud, DC, shared) without coercion fallback","rebar-type: prefix must be added to all four internal-label exclusion tuples to prevent spurious inbound syncing"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787475881245144001,"uuid":"6420b1ba-64e5-4fc9-988c-c1289b57ea1b"}